        <div class="post-7014 page type-page status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
      <div class="col-12 px-lg-8 px-3">
        
<div style="height:60px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<div class="wp-block-columns container px-lg-8 d-block px-2 is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center" style="font-size:30px">Guided Tours</h2>



<div style="height:30px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="has-text-align-center has-black-color has-text-color wp-block-paragraph"><strong>You can visit the theatre everyday from 9:30AM to 7:00PM<br></strong>(last tour at 6:20PM)</p>



<p class="has-text-align-center has-black-color has-text-color wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Groups of at least 10 people can contact us to reserve the guided tour </strong><br>(<a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="aed8c7ddc7dacbc9dbc7cacfdacbeedacbcfdadcc1c3cfddddc7c3c180c7da">[email&#160;protected]</a> &#8211; tel. 335 7891664 &#8211; 091 6053267)</p>



<p class="has-text-align-center has-black-color has-text-color wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Individuals can purchase their ticket at the box-office or <a href="https://www.ticketone.it/en/artist/teatro-massimo/visite-guidate-teatro-massimo-2675423/">online</a></strong></p>



<div style="height:15px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>


<div class="container simple-button p-0 align-center">
  <a class="simple-button__item " href="https://www.ticketone.it/en/artist/teatro-massimo/visite-guidate-teatro-massimo-2675423/?gclid=Cj0KCQjwhqaVBhCxARIsAHK1tiNC8xonm2WxFC80S5L39hk5PVpWV6ir6Bh7vGLqm6ujvTFcQAhqQMAaAgkGEALw_wcB" target="_blank" style="background-color: #ac8941; border: 2px solid #ac8941; color: #ffffff">
    Buy now
  </a>
</div>



<div style="height:31px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<div style="height:31px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-black-color has-text-color">DISCOVER THE BEAUTY OF PALERMO<br>with out OPERART combo tickets<br></h2>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-black-color has-text-color"><strong>OPERART</strong> Palazzo Butera<br>Discover the <strong>Teatro Massimo </strong>and<strong> Palazzo Butera</strong>: get the<strong> combo ticket (19 €)</strong> <br>and enjoy both a guided tour of the opera house and the Valsecchi art collection in <br>the historical Palazzo Butera.</h3>



<div style="height:15px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>


<div class="container simple-button p-0 align-center">
  <a class="simple-button__item " href="https://palazzobutera.it/it" target="_blank" style="background-color: #ffffff; border: 2px solid #888888; color: #000000">
    Go to Palazzo Butera&#039;s website
  </a>
</div>



<div style="height:31px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-black-color has-text-color"><strong>OPERART</strong> Palazzo Branciforte and Villa Zito<br>One ticket to triple the beauty!<br>Visit the Teatro Massimo,&nbsp;<a href="https://www.palazzobranciforte.it/">Palazzo Branciforte</a> and <a href="https://www.villazito.it/">Villa Zito</a><br>with our combo ticket <br>(Full price 19 €, group concession 14 €).</h3>



<p class="has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph"></p>



<div style="height:80px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>


<section class="accordion px-2">
  <div class="accordion__toggler d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center px-3 py-2">
    <div>
      Standard Guided Tour
    </div>
    <div class="accordion__arrow">
      <div>
        <svg width="21" height="12" viewBox="0 0 21 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M20.6248 1.49977C20.6248 1.11595 20.4809 0.731954 20.1932 0.439454C19.6177 -0.146484 18.6854 -0.146484 18.1099 0.439454L10.3123 8.38102L2.51482 0.439453C1.93935 -0.146484 1.00708 -0.146484 0.431605 0.439453C-0.143869 1.02539 -0.143869 1.97461 0.431605 2.56055L9.27089 11.5605C9.84636 12.1465 10.7786 12.1465 11.3541 11.5605L20.1934 2.56055C20.482 2.26852 20.6248 1.88414 20.6248 1.49977Z" fill="#8d7134"/>
</svg>      </div>
      <div class="active d-none">
        <svg width="21" height="12" viewBox="0 0 21 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M20.6248 10.5002C20.6248 10.884 20.4809 11.268 20.1932 11.5605C19.6177 12.1465 18.6854 12.1465 18.1099 11.5605L10.3123 3.61898L2.51482 11.5605C1.93935 12.1465 1.00708 12.1465 0.431605 11.5605C-0.143869 10.9746 -0.143869 10.0254 0.431605 9.43945L9.27089 0.439453C9.84636 -0.146485 10.7786 -0.146485 11.3541 0.439453L20.1934 9.43945C20.482 9.73148 20.6248 10.1159 20.6248 10.5002Z" fill="white"/>
</svg>      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
  <div class="accordion__content py-3 px-lg-4">
    

<p class="has-black-color has-text-color wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:16px">Get to know the Massimo with a guided tour: explore the stunning auditorium and the most interesting halls of the third largest opera house in Europe.</p>



<p class="has-black-color has-text-color wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:16px">The tour lasts about 40 minutes and is available in Italian, English, French, Spanish and German. <br>Groups are welcome to reserve the tour in advance and may request to visit the theatre during closing time as well (in this case booking is compulsory).</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>The tour is accessible.</strong> <a href="https://www.teatromassimo.it/en/explore-the-teatro-massimo-with-our-audio-guides-and-video-guides/">Explore the Teatro Massimo with our audio and video guides</a>. The guided tour of the theatre has a reduced cost of 6 euros per person for people with disabilities and one accompanying person. 3D models and tactile maps are available to enhance the experience of the blind and partially blind.</p>



<div style="height:50px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="has-black-color has-text-color wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:26px"><strong>Tickets</strong></p>



<div class="wp-block-columns flex-wrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><div class="container simple-button p-0 align-">
  <a class="simple-button__item simple-button__item--small" href="https://www.ticketone.it/artist/teatro-massimo/visite-guidate-teatro-massimo-2675423/" target="_blank" style="background-color: #ac8941; border: 2px solid #ac8941; color: #ffffff">
    Buy now
  </a>
</div>
</div>
</div>



<div style="height:30px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Ticket fares valid until June 30 2026</strong></h4>



<div class="wp-block-group is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained">
<figure class="wp-block-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Full price</th><th>Under 26</th><th>Groups<br>(at least 20 people)</th><th>Palermo Citizens</th><th>School Groups</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>€ 12,00</td><td>€ 6,00</td><td>€ 9,00</td><td>€ 4,00</td><td>€ 3,00</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption class="wp-element-caption"><strong>Family Ticket</strong>: € 30 (2 adults + 2&nbsp;under26)&nbsp; | <strong>Free entrance for children under 6</strong><br><br></figcaption></figure>
</div>



<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>New Ticket fares valid from July 1 2026</strong></h4>



<figure class="wp-block-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Full price</th><th>Under 26</th><th>Groups<br>(at least 20 people)</th><th>Palermo Citizens</th><th>School Groups</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>€ 14,00</td><td>€ 7,00</td><td>€ 10,00</td><td>€ 4,00</td><td>€ 4,00</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption class="wp-element-caption"><strong>Family Ticket</strong>: € 36 (2 adults + 2&nbsp;under26)&nbsp; | <strong>Free entrance for children under 6</strong></figcaption></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>



<div class="wp-block-group is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained"><section class="badges d-flex justify-content-center flex-wrap px-2">
          <a  href="https://www.teatromassimo.it/en/getting-to-the-teatro-massimo/"  target="" title="Getting here" class="badges__item">
      <img decoding="async" class="badges__item-image" src="https://www.teatromassimo.it/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Vector.png" alt="Getting here">
      <span class="badges__item-text">Getting here</span>
    </a>
  </section>
</div>


  </div>
</section>



<div style="height:80px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>


<section class="accordion px-2">
  <div class="accordion__toggler d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center px-3 py-2">
    <div>
      Backstage Tour
    </div>
    <div class="accordion__arrow">
      <div>
        <svg width="21" height="12" viewBox="0 0 21 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M20.6248 1.49977C20.6248 1.11595 20.4809 0.731954 20.1932 0.439454C19.6177 -0.146484 18.6854 -0.146484 18.1099 0.439454L10.3123 8.38102L2.51482 0.439453C1.93935 -0.146484 1.00708 -0.146484 0.431605 0.439453C-0.143869 1.02539 -0.143869 1.97461 0.431605 2.56055L9.27089 11.5605C9.84636 12.1465 10.7786 12.1465 11.3541 11.5605L20.1934 2.56055C20.482 2.26852 20.6248 1.88414 20.6248 1.49977Z" fill="#8d7134"/>
</svg>      </div>
      <div class="active d-none">
        <svg width="21" height="12" viewBox="0 0 21 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M20.6248 10.5002C20.6248 10.884 20.4809 11.268 20.1932 11.5605C19.6177 12.1465 18.6854 12.1465 18.1099 11.5605L10.3123 3.61898L2.51482 11.5605C1.93935 12.1465 1.00708 12.1465 0.431605 11.5605C-0.143869 10.9746 -0.143869 10.0254 0.431605 9.43945L9.27089 0.439453C9.84636 -0.146485 10.7786 -0.146485 11.3541 0.439453L20.1934 9.43945C20.482 9.73148 20.6248 10.1159 20.6248 10.5002Z" fill="white"/>
</svg>      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
  <div class="accordion__content py-3 px-lg-4">
    

<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Visit the stage and see what&#8217;s behind an opera, a concert or a ballet at the Massimo! <br>You will never experience the same tour twice, as the stage changes according to what is being performed. <br>Booking is compulsory for this tour and must be planned according to production times (the stage will not be accessible during rehearsals, performances and technical work).</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The backstage is partially accessible to people with reduced mobility or on a wheelchair.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Tickets</strong> € 5 (plus the standard guided tour ticket)</p>


  </div>
</section>



<div style="height:80px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>


<section class="accordion px-2">
  <div class="accordion__toggler d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center px-3 py-2">
    <div>
      Cocktail Tour
    </div>
    <div class="accordion__arrow">
      <div>
        <svg width="21" height="12" viewBox="0 0 21 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M20.6248 1.49977C20.6248 1.11595 20.4809 0.731954 20.1932 0.439454C19.6177 -0.146484 18.6854 -0.146484 18.1099 0.439454L10.3123 8.38102L2.51482 0.439453C1.93935 -0.146484 1.00708 -0.146484 0.431605 0.439453C-0.143869 1.02539 -0.143869 1.97461 0.431605 2.56055L9.27089 11.5605C9.84636 12.1465 10.7786 12.1465 11.3541 11.5605L20.1934 2.56055C20.482 2.26852 20.6248 1.88414 20.6248 1.49977Z" fill="#8d7134"/>
</svg>      </div>
      <div class="active d-none">
        <svg width="21" height="12" viewBox="0 0 21 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M20.6248 10.5002C20.6248 10.884 20.4809 11.268 20.1932 11.5605C19.6177 12.1465 18.6854 12.1465 18.1099 11.5605L10.3123 3.61898L2.51482 11.5605C1.93935 12.1465 1.00708 12.1465 0.431605 11.5605C-0.143869 10.9746 -0.143869 10.0254 0.431605 9.43945L9.27089 0.439453C9.84636 -0.146485 10.7786 -0.146485 11.3541 0.439453L20.1934 9.43945C20.482 9.73148 20.6248 10.1159 20.6248 10.5002Z" fill="white"/>
</svg>      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
  <div class="accordion__content py-3 px-lg-4">
    

<p class="has-black-color has-text-color wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:16px">You can book a special guided tour that includes a cocktail in the sitting room of the Royal Box.</p>



<p class="has-black-color has-text-color wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:16px">The tour is offered to groups of at least 15 and up to 30 people. Booking is compulsory (at least 7 days in advance).&nbsp;</p>



<p class="has-black-color has-text-color wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:16px">This tour is accessible and lasts about 60 minutes.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>



<p class="has-black-color has-text-color wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:16px"><strong>Tickets</strong>&nbsp;€ 55,00<br>No concessions available; the price may vary if you request a tour out of the Theatre&#8217;s opening hours.</p>


  </div>
</section>



<div style="height:80px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>


<section class="accordion px-2">
  <div class="accordion__toggler d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center px-3 py-2">
    <div>
      Concert &amp; Cocktail Tour
    </div>
    <div class="accordion__arrow">
      <div>
        <svg width="21" height="12" viewBox="0 0 21 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M20.6248 1.49977C20.6248 1.11595 20.4809 0.731954 20.1932 0.439454C19.6177 -0.146484 18.6854 -0.146484 18.1099 0.439454L10.3123 8.38102L2.51482 0.439453C1.93935 -0.146484 1.00708 -0.146484 0.431605 0.439453C-0.143869 1.02539 -0.143869 1.97461 0.431605 2.56055L9.27089 11.5605C9.84636 12.1465 10.7786 12.1465 11.3541 11.5605L20.1934 2.56055C20.482 2.26852 20.6248 1.88414 20.6248 1.49977Z" fill="#8d7134"/>
</svg>      </div>
      <div class="active d-none">
        <svg width="21" height="12" viewBox="0 0 21 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M20.6248 10.5002C20.6248 10.884 20.4809 11.268 20.1932 11.5605C19.6177 12.1465 18.6854 12.1465 18.1099 11.5605L10.3123 3.61898L2.51482 11.5605C1.93935 12.1465 1.00708 12.1465 0.431605 11.5605C-0.143869 10.9746 -0.143869 10.0254 0.431605 9.43945L9.27089 0.439453C9.84636 -0.146485 10.7786 -0.146485 11.3541 0.439453L20.1934 9.43945C20.482 9.73148 20.6248 10.1159 20.6248 10.5002Z" fill="white"/>
</svg>      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
  <div class="accordion__content py-3 px-lg-4">
    

<p class="has-black-color has-text-color wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:16px">This option, <strong>available to groups ranging from 30 to 100 people</strong>, includes a special concert in one of the Halls of the Theatre, a cocktail in the sitting room of the Royal Box and the guided tour of the opera house. </p>



<p class="has-black-color has-text-color wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:16px">Booking is compulsory (at least 7 days in advance). </p>



<p class="has-black-color has-text-color wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:16px">This tour is fully accessible and lasts about 90 minutes.</p>



<p class="has-black-color has-text-color wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:16px"><strong>Tickets</strong>&nbsp;€ 95,00<br>No concessions available; the price may vary if you request a tour out of the Theatre&#8217;s opening hours.</p>


  </div>
</section>



<div style="height:80px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>


<section class="accordion px-2">
  <div class="accordion__toggler d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center px-3 py-2">
    <div>
      OPERART Combo Tour &#8211; PALAZZO BUTERA
    </div>
    <div class="accordion__arrow">
      <div>
        <svg width="21" height="12" viewBox="0 0 21 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M20.6248 1.49977C20.6248 1.11595 20.4809 0.731954 20.1932 0.439454C19.6177 -0.146484 18.6854 -0.146484 18.1099 0.439454L10.3123 8.38102L2.51482 0.439453C1.93935 -0.146484 1.00708 -0.146484 0.431605 0.439453C-0.143869 1.02539 -0.143869 1.97461 0.431605 2.56055L9.27089 11.5605C9.84636 12.1465 10.7786 12.1465 11.3541 11.5605L20.1934 2.56055C20.482 2.26852 20.6248 1.88414 20.6248 1.49977Z" fill="#8d7134"/>
</svg>      </div>
      <div class="active d-none">
        <svg width="21" height="12" viewBox="0 0 21 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M20.6248 10.5002C20.6248 10.884 20.4809 11.268 20.1932 11.5605C19.6177 12.1465 18.6854 12.1465 18.1099 11.5605L10.3123 3.61898L2.51482 11.5605C1.93935 12.1465 1.00708 12.1465 0.431605 11.5605C-0.143869 10.9746 -0.143869 10.0254 0.431605 9.43945L9.27089 0.439453C9.84636 -0.146485 10.7786 -0.146485 11.3541 0.439453L20.1934 9.43945C20.482 9.73148 20.6248 10.1159 20.6248 10.5002Z" fill="white"/>
</svg>      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
  <div class="accordion__content py-3 px-lg-4">
    

<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>



<p class="has-black-color has-text-color wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:16px">Discover the Teatro Massimo and Palazzo Butera: get the combo ticket and enjoy both a guided tour of the opera house and the Valsecchi art collection in the historical Palazzo Butera. Tickets are available at the box-offices of the Teatro Massimo and Palazzo Butera. <br><strong>Operart Combo Ticket fare until June 30 2026: 17 € &#8211; Ticket fare from July 1 2026: 19 €</strong></p>



<figure class="wp-block-image aligncenter size-full"><a href="https://www.teatromassimo.it/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/flyer-OPERART-giu25.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="760" height="428" src="/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/OPERART-2.jpeg" alt="" class="wp-image-1234" srcset="https://www.teatromassimo.it/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/OPERART-2.jpeg 760w, https://www.teatromassimo.it/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/OPERART-2-600x338.jpeg 600w, https://www.teatromassimo.it/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/OPERART-2-356x200.jpeg 356w" sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px" /></a></figure>


  </div>
</section>



<div style="height:80px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>


<section class="accordion px-2">
  <div class="accordion__toggler d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center px-3 py-2">
    <div>
      OPERART Combo Tour &#8211; FONDAZIONE SICILIA
    </div>
    <div class="accordion__arrow">
      <div>
        <svg width="21" height="12" viewBox="0 0 21 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M20.6248 1.49977C20.6248 1.11595 20.4809 0.731954 20.1932 0.439454C19.6177 -0.146484 18.6854 -0.146484 18.1099 0.439454L10.3123 8.38102L2.51482 0.439453C1.93935 -0.146484 1.00708 -0.146484 0.431605 0.439453C-0.143869 1.02539 -0.143869 1.97461 0.431605 2.56055L9.27089 11.5605C9.84636 12.1465 10.7786 12.1465 11.3541 11.5605L20.1934 2.56055C20.482 2.26852 20.6248 1.88414 20.6248 1.49977Z" fill="#8d7134"/>
</svg>      </div>
